<main class="page">
<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">[[Réserver||Book]]</p><h1>[[Une table pour ce soir ?||A table for tonight?]]</h1><p class="lead">[[Nous confirmons chaque réservation par e-mail. Pour plus de 8 personnes, appelez-nous.||We confirm every booking by email. For more than 8 guests, give us a call.]]</p></div></section>
<section class="section section--tight"><div class="container"><form class="form form--narrow" data-revel-form="[[reservation||booking]]"><div class="form__row"><label class="field"><span class="field__label">Date</span><input class="field__input" type="date" name="date" required></label><label class="field"><span class="field__label">[[Heure||Time]]</span><select class="field__input" name="[[heure||time]]"><option>12:00</option><option>12:30</option><option>13:00</option><option>19:00</option><option>19:30</option><option>20:00</option><option>20:30</option><option>21:00</option></select></label></div><div class="form__row"><label class="field"><span class="field__label">[[Personnes||Guests]]</span><input class="field__input" type="number" name="[[personnes||guests]]" min="1" max="8" value="2" required></label><label class="field"><span class="field__label">[[Téléphone||Phone]]</span><input class="field__input" type="tel" name="[[telephone||phone]]" autocomplete="tel" required></label></div><div class="form__row"><label class="field"><span class="field__label">[[Nom||Name]]</span><input class="field__input" type="text" name="[[nom||name]]" autocomplete="name" required></label><label class="field"><span class="field__label">[[E-mail||Email]]</span><input class="field__input" type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required></label></div><label class="field"><span class="field__label">[[Une précision ?||Anything to add?]]</span><textarea class="field__input" name="message" rows="3"></textarea></label><button class="btn" type="submit">[[Demander la réservation||Request the booking]]</button><p class="form__status" data-revel-form-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></form></div></section>
</main>
